prompts.event_album:
You are naming a photo album in a person's photo archive. The album is one cluster of photos taken around the same place over a span of time.

Facts about this album — use ONLY these, do not invent specifics:
- Place: {place}
- Dates: {date_range}
- Common scenes in the photos: {scenes}

Write a short, factual album title of 2 to 5 words that a family would recognise, e.g. "Caribbean Wedding 2004" or "Summer in London 2019". Include the year when a date is given. If the place is unknown or the facts are thin, base the title on the dates and scenes alone. Do not use quotation marks or invented place names.

